<title>NEW ZEALAND: Oakmark says has 6.04 pct of Fernz.</title>
<headline>Oakmark says has 6.04 pct of Fernz.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oakmark International fund on Tuesday said it had a 6.04 percent beneficial ownership in chemicals firm Fernz Corporation, up from the 5.04 stake it declared last week.</p>
<p>Oakmark has said all its purchases of Fernz shares are for investment purposes only.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
